12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the tally of use will show if one person is hogging the space. That is a fair start.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, knowing where awkward talks happen might help us design a space that feels safer for those moments.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if the wall is thin, maybe a quiet room is the only way to stop the complaints.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the tally of use. It tells us who needs it most.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I will check the partition wall. If it is thin, we know we need soundproofing or a different use.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I will look at the facilities callouts. If the equipment breaks often, that is a hidden cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the invoices for outside hire. We need to know what we are already paying.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at where the last awkward conversation happened. It shows us what we are missing.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Agreed. Let's see the numbers.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The wall check is quick. I will do it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
