35,2,1,talk,May,,The tally shows the two people nearest the door used it eleven times. The rest of us only four.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The wall is single plasterboard. I could hear a phone call clearly from my desk. It is not private.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,Facilities logged eleven callouts for equipment. The empty store room had zero. The equipment is the problem.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"We paid 68,000 yen last year for outside hire. The quotes for fit-outs are 141,000 and 96,000.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The last awkward talk happened across the desks, in front of everyone. We have no private space for hard things.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the wall is that thin, a quiet room might just move the noise problem to the office.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, exactly. But if we make it a meeting space, we can book it and control who is in there.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, the 141,000 quote is for the screen and table. That is for meetings. The 96,000 is for the kitchen.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, the kitchen quote is cheaper, but the maintenance might be higher. The invoices show we already pay for outside space.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if we make it a meeting space, we can have those awkward talks there, not in the open.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"The crumbs under the keyboards are bad. If we make it a kitchen, we need to clean up properly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The unplanned talk only happens by the printer now. We need a dedicated space for real conversations.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,The callouts suggest the equipment is unreliable. A meeting space with a screen might be less prone to breakdowns than a kitchen.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,The invoices show we are paying for space we don't use well. A meeting space could be booked and used efficiently.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,A meeting space gives us a place to talk without the whole office listening. That is what we need.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I am leaning towards a meeting space. It solves the privacy issue and the usage imbalance.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. A quiet room is too restrictive. A meeting space is flexible.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,"The cost is higher, but the reliability is better. I support the meeting space.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"The budget is tight, but the meeting space is the most efficient use of the room. I support it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,It gives us a place to be honest with each other. I support the meeting space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
